# Module: cards
Compile unit for the Forum Frontend.
Generates: `frontend/src/components/cards.tsx` (current hand-authored code is the reference output)

Imports the shared upvote control from the sibling `upvote_button` module (`prompts/frontend/components/upvote_button_typescriptreact.prompt` → `frontend/src/components/upvote_button.tsx`); never re-implement that interaction here.

## Components
- **FeatureCard** — status pill per stage: `CONSOLIDATING` "🪄 AI Merging Duplicates" (animated wand), `IN_SPRINT` "🛠️ AI Building" (loading ring), `COMPILED` "🎉 Live in Sandbox" (green flash), `SPLIT` "🚀 AI Evolving" (expandable). `VOTING` cards render the `UpvoteButton` (default size); other stages show a frozen vote count. Cards with `extends_id` show a subtle "🧬 Builds on {base title}" reference.
- **UnlockTree** (inside SPLIT expansion) — parent title + child rows: lock/unlock icon, progress bar toward `unlock_threshold`, per-child `UpvoteButton` (small size), unlocked celebration state.
- **HoldingCard** — "Structural Paradox Detected" header, holding cycle x of 2, `ai_explanation` in an empathetic callout.
- **VaultCard** — archive copy ("Archived due to low community velocity...") + "⚡ Reboot request" action.
- **ShippedCard** — "🏆 Shipped in {version}" pill, author credit, final vote count, shipped date.

